# Loft theme "latte" — KDE color scheme "Loft", generated by `loft theme render`, do not edit.
# Linked to ~/.local/share/color-schemes/Loft.colors by the `qt` hook; KDE apps
# use it when their rc file says [UiSettings] ColorScheme=Loft (dolphinrc).

